@startuml
title SA-S02 — Event quote and booking lifecycle
caption Event resource and financial gates | PRD-13–17
[*] --> Applied
Applied --> Quoted : record tentative window
Applied --> Cancelled : owner cancels before quote acceptance
Applied --> Applied : merchant proposes alternative schedule, no commitment
Quoted --> AwaitingDeposit : accept current quote
AwaitingDeposit --> DepositReview : timely valid proof registered
AwaitingDeposit --> Cancelled : customer confirms no transfer, release unused window
AwaitingDeposit --> Expired : deadline without timely proof
Quoted --> Expired : deadline without timely proof
Quoted --> Cancelled : free cancellation before quote acceptance
DepositReview --> Booked : verify and apply DEC-021 balance deadline
DepositReview --> PaymentException : verified but no longer feasible [DEC-021]
DepositReview --> PaymentException : late or mismatched receipt
DepositReview --> Cancelled : merchant explicitly rejects, release unused window
PaymentException --> Booked : reconciled and booking eligible
PaymentException --> Booked : agreed reschedule and valid effective balance recorded
PaymentException --> Proceeding : agreed reschedule and balance already settled
PaymentException --> Cancelled : refund disposition recorded
Booked --> Proceeding : balance verified
Booked --> Grace : balance overdue
Grace --> Proceeding : balance verified
Grace --> Cancelled : after cutoff, merchant verifies no balance funds and review is resolved
Grace --> Cancelled : merchant unable, full refund of receipts
Grace --> Grace : timely balance proof holds slot through review [DEC-026]
Proceeding --> EquipmentCheck : setup and teardown complete
Proceeding --> Cancelled : merchant unable, full refund of receipts
Proceeding --> Proceeding : customer cancellation denied, no refund
EquipmentCheck --> AdditionalBill : charge applicable
EquipmentCheck --> Completed : no charge
AdditionalBill --> Completed : verify receipt
Booked --> Cancelled : merchant unable, full refund of receipts
note right of DepositReview
  Timely proof keeps the tentative window [DEC-020].
  Sending a transfer ends customer cancellation [DEC-023].
end note
@enduml
